    cover_note='Welcome to Session 9. Until now you have watched what AI can do and where it fails. Today you write the rules. By the end of the session you hold a first draft of your own company AI use policy and a risk register for your task. We start from an invented handbook clause from Nile Valley Foods, and you work on your own company for forty-five minutes. Before we begin, tell me in one sentence which AI use in your company worries you most, and if you brought a rule your company already has, keep it handy.',
