    plan_note='Three parts take most of the time. Twenty-five minutes on the idea: five risks, three frameworks and the law in Uganda. Twenty minutes on a worked example, where one handbook clause from Nile Valley Foods becomes part of a policy. After the break, forty-five minutes are yours: the risk register first, then the policy draft. The last ten minutes are for one decision, who owns the policy.',
